#: scenario7:scenario7_CDE966D8_424B_449D_BDB0_A302D8A9E8BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: afe2ee0df52fa8ca82d833391f275182d2ea718cc0f8833cc93a21cbcbbe8050
