#: scenario7:scenario7_693D17D2_4D59_444F_8262_01C1D36A1DE5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4c8414495d8c230dd1513f5df223ed764ebe141e013a426a0c8eba90b835dd0
