msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What would you call that—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the “power of love”?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Is ⟪k:5⟫that⟪k:6⟫ what "
"allowed this to happen?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫How trite. ⟪k:9⟫Where’s the magic—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫the ⟪k:12⟫"
"miracle⟪k:13⟫?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Do que você chamaria isso—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫o “poder do amor”?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Foi ⟪k:5⟫isso⟪k:6⟫ que "
"permitiu que isto acontecesse?⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Que banal. ⟪k:9⟫Onde está a magia—⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫o ⟪k:12⟫"
"milagre⟪k:13⟫?"

