#: scenario7:scenario7_D3387E17_242B_4891_9DEB_F2FA0A2444A8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ce71c4217f05c88f91e95212e4458b9e6ce8427f4c6bffe3c944c5703ed1793
