msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If the tale you showed me was the whole truth..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se a história que você me mostrou fosse toda a verdade..."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D7064C1C_1266_459D_9946_229AE6683B85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f70c99caa1b9afc3678cb9716681f824c45df7e2ca69837a7e227543737737fd
