msgid "⟪k:0⟫then I would have said you could revile those heartless men as much as you pleased."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫então eu teria dito que você poderia insultar aqueles homens sem coração tanto quanto "
"quisesse."

#: scenario7:scenario7_80AEDE1A_E079_4F43_BF1F_DC7B5D439794
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cde1d0d263933042c952ec4574c73b9d3e271afe81c640615eebd29757491ed4
