msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫They felt things—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫real, human emotions—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫even if those things ultimately "
"led them down a path of destruction."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eles sentiram coisas—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫emoções humanas reais—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫mesmo que essas coisas os "
"levassem a um caminho de destruição."

#: scenario7:scenario7_CEC94C5E_2B7D_4088_BCB5_CE4948592495
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d7d1bf9ef8c418d0abce53ddef8d17a5cec8a06815d5a4171db7354a4d01da56
